    "A Stellar account that no one person controls — including you.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A Stellar account that no one person controls — including you."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Аккаунт Stellar, которым не распоряжается никто в одиночку — включая вас."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Stellar account this chat controls together": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A Stellar account this chat controls together"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Аккаунт Stellar, которым этот чат распоряжается сообща"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A directory is a phone book of available services. Onym verifies every entry on this device before showing it to you — adding a second one widens what you can choose from.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A directory is a phone book of available services. Onym verifies every entry on this device before showing it to you — adding a second one widens what you can choose from."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Каталог — это телефонная книга доступных сервисов. Onym проверяет каждую запись на этом устройстве, прежде чем показать её вам; второй каталог расширяет выбор."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A file anyone can check with any Ed25519 tool — it explains how inside.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A file anyone can check with any Ed25519 tool — it explains how inside."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Файл, который каждый может проверить любым инструментом Ed25519 — внутри описано как."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fresh key — separate contacts and chats from your other identities.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A fresh key — separate contacts and chats from your other identities."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Новый ключ — контакты и чаты отделены от других ваших личностей."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A name only you see. It doesn't change your keys or your invite link.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A name only you see. It doesn't change your keys or your invite link."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Имя, которое видите только вы. Оно не меняет ваши ключи и ссылку-приглашение."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A notary keeps every group's membership and history honest. It checks each change with a zero-knowledge proof, so it can confirm a group is genuine without learning who is in it or what was said.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A notary keeps every group's membership and history honest. It checks each change with a zero-knowledge proof, so it can confirm a group is genuine without learning who is in it or what was said."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Нотариус следит за честностью состава и истории каждой группы. Он проверяет каждое изменение доказательством с нулевым разглашением: подтверждает подлинность группы, не узнавая, кто в ней состоит и о чём шла речь."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A signature is stored and it doesn’t check out. Nothing here can be shown as an agreement.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A signature is stored and it doesn’t check out. Nothing here can be shown as an agreement."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Подпись сохранена, и она не проходит проверку. Ничто здесь нельзя предъявить как согласие."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A signature is stored, but the wording it covers isn’t on this device, so nothing here can check it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A signature is stored, but the wording it covers isn’t on this device, so nothing here can check it."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Подпись сохранена, но формулировки, которую она покрывает, нет на этом устройстве — проверить её здесь нечем."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A treasury for this chat": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
