            "value": "Every relay in this list carries every message — they're used together, not as fallbacks. Any one that's up is enough to reach you."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Каждый релей из этого списка переносит каждое сообщение — они работают вместе, а не как запасные. Достаточно любого работающего, чтобы до вас дойти."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everyone in the group will see the new name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Everyone in the group will see the new name."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Все участники группы увидят новое название."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everyone in this chat will see the address you choose, and anyone who has it can read that account's entire history on Stellar — its balance, and every payment it has ever made or received. If you would rather that history not be linked to you here, use an account you keep for this.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Everyone in this chat will see the address you choose, and anyone who has it can read that account's entire history on Stellar — its balance, and every payment it has ever made or received. If you would rather that history not be linked to you here, use an account you keep for this."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Все в этом чате увидят выбранный вами адрес, а любой, у кого он есть, прочитает всю историю этого аккаунта в Stellar — баланс и каждый платёж, отправленный или полученный. Если не хотите связывать эту историю с собой здесь, заведите отдельный аккаунт."
          }
        }
      }
    },
