    },
    "Onym holds the key for this one, so signing is a single tap. It comes back with your recovery phrase, and it is a different key from the one that signs your messages.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Onym holds the key for this one, so signing is a single tap. It comes back with your recovery phrase, and it is a different key from the one that signs your messages."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ключ от этого аккаунта хранит Onym, поэтому подпись — одно нажатие. Он восстанавливается по вашей фразе восстановления и отличается от ключа, которым подписываются сообщения."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Onym never sees this key. When there is something to sign, it hands the transaction to your wallet and takes back only the signature.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Onym never sees this key. When there is something to sign, it hands the transaction to your wallet and takes back only the signature."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Этот ключ Onym не видит никогда. Когда нужно что-то подписать, он передаёт транзакцию в ваш кошелёк и забирает только подпись."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Onym runs on independent services for delivery, files and timestamps. Start with a set that works, or pick your own.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Onym runs on independent services for delivery, files and timestamps. Start with a set that works, or pick your own."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Onym работает на независимых сервисах доставки, файлов и меток времени. Начните с готового набора или выберите свои."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Out of %lld co-signers. Requiring everyone means one lost phone freezes the treasury for good — there is no way to remove a key without its own signature.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Out of %lld co-signers. Requiring everyone means one lost phone freezes the treasury for good — there is no way to remove a key without its own signature."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Из %lld соподписантов. Требовать подписи всех — значит заморозить казну навсегда из-за одного потерянного телефона: удалить ключ без его же подписи нельзя."
          }
        }
      }
    },
