            "value": "Фраза создаётся на устройстве и никогда его не покидает."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The treasury exists. Everyone in the chat can see it now.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The treasury exists. Everyone in the chat can see it now."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Казна создана. Теперь её видят все в чате."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The treasury's own key is switched off as it is created. After that you cannot move its money alone, and neither can anyone else.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The treasury's own key is switched off as it is created. After that you cannot move its money alone, and neither can anyone else."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Собственный ключ казны отключается прямо при её создании. После этого ни вы, ни кто-либо другой не сможет распоряжаться её деньгами в одиночку."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There’s nothing to show about this member’s agreement any more.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
